 "text": "9/29/26, 9:39 AM\n\nMove-Out\n\nUse\n\nDuring the move-out transaction, you execute most of the activities required to cancel the customer's supply of utilities services.\nYou make changes to the business partner master data that result from a move-out. You specifically end the allocation of a\n\ncontract to an installation on the move-out date.\n\nMove-out\n\nInstallation |\n\nMove-out processing stops the active payment plans. A move-out confirmation letter and an immediate bill can also be triggered\n\nfrom the move-out.\n\nPrerequisites\n\nYou require one or more existing contracts with installations for the requested move-out date to create a move-out.\n\nFeatures\n\nBudget Billing Plan\n\nIn Customizing under IkMove-In/Out & Move-Out*s Define Move-Out Contro!] Parameters at Contract level \u2122 vou can snecifv\n",
